    "text": "Report export counts and reject unknown formats. An export now prints how many notes it wrote, and an unknown --format exits with status 2 instead of a traceback. Sync skips the push when there is nothing to send.",
    "sources": [
      "commit 1fd9980"
    ],
    "isMissing": false
  },
